The .tflite drops here.

Filenames expected by detection/TfliteRunner via PramanaApp:
    pramana-int8.tflite      (primary — INT8 quantized)
    pramana-int4.tflite      (secondary — INT4 quantized, if Workbench produced one)

How to produce:
    1. Train PyTorch model (ml/src/train.py).
    2. Run ml/src/workbench/compile.py + quantize.py + profile.py against
       AI Hub Workbench using your QAI_HUB_API_TOKEN.
    3. Workbench returns a .tflite per quant tier. Drop them here.

The runner falls back to the mock detector if no .tflite is present, so
the app is fully runnable on the iQOO Z5 without a trained model.
